{"id":"2819053570","kind":"answer","title":"高中生物应该背书还是刷题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2022-12-28","updated":"2022-12-28","votes":186,"comment_count":13,"minutes":2,"chars":1013,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","记忆卡片","知识表征","助记媒介"],"summary":"这个我有经验 2333，我的生物在 单科质检 时是全市第 4 名（同分同名） 当然是全都要 先说个简单的小故事： 很久很久以前，在一个热带荒岛上，有一个遭遇海难的倒霉蛋在使劲种田，麻雀来啄嫩芽时发现没有稻草人，暴雨来临时发现没有棚屋，丰收时发现没有仓库。随着时间流逝，在高温和潮湿的作用下，粮食很快发霉腐烂，无法食用。 真正要在…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/549046188/answer/2819053570","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"当然是全都要"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"如何高效背生物"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"如何刷题"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"刷题和背书如何结合"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"进一步阅读"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"SKY6BxB8\">这个我有经验 2333，我的生物在<span class=\"nolink\">单科质检</span>时是全市第 4 名（同分同名）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-334a643fa7fca64a3176e0fb8aa74c82_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3ce09e3521b49be6dd09655be8c59bef\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3ce09e3521b49be6dd09655be8c59bef_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"802\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-334a643fa7fca64a3176e0fb8aa74c82_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3ce09e3521b49be6dd09655be8c59bef\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3ce09e3521b49be6dd09655be8c59bef_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"802\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-1\">当然是全都要</h2><p data-pid=\"eIEw0dm_\">先说个简单的小故事：</p><p data-pid=\"o1gEgfxZ\">很久很久以前，在一个热带荒岛上，有一个遭遇海难的倒霉蛋在使劲种田，麻雀来啄嫩芽时发现没有稻草人，暴雨来临时发现没有棚屋，丰收时发现没有仓库。随着时间流逝，在高温和潮湿的作用下，粮食很快发霉腐烂，无法食用。</p><p data-pid=\"_7ggmoxL\">真正要在荒岛上生存，应当像鲁滨逊那样，一边种粮一边修地窖和棚屋、编藤篮和稻草人。待到丰收日，计算来年的种子和余粮数量，做到未雨绸缪、合理规划。</p><p data-pid=\"5K4GsOsS\">学习也像荒岛生存。如果一味的刷题，没有抽出归纳知识和记忆知识的时间，就像第一个倒霉蛋那样，学到的知识很快就归零了。没有计划则会导致对高考的备考没有时间观念，将过多时间花在某一个模块上，最后时间紧张，自己也对高考没底。</p><p data-pid=\"B49XzuLK\">唯有像鲁滨逊那样，我们才能将学过的完好地知识储存到高考那天。而且，有条理的复习可以加强信心，设定合理的目标。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-09750bb72a4517a5e0f2df0da3a907ae_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f6c6b8e1f6b1d1de9981e3b0dcd02118\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f6c6b8e1f6b1d1de9981e3b0dcd02118_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-09750bb72a4517a5e0f2df0da3a907ae_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f6c6b8e1f6b1d1de9981e3b0dcd02118\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f6c6b8e1f6b1d1de9981e3b0dcd02118_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"nvuqfOP1\">因此，我们要形成学习闭环，让背书和刷题能够相辅相成。那具体该怎么做呢？</p><p data-pid=\"Pp9RydC7\">咱先说说背书。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">如何高效背生物</h2><p data-pid=\"-O1CPfvL\">我的方法是用 Anki：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b4ad28fea2a6dce87174d4b14298bf9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-08564c290f7da4c19fbdf84a6d342c94\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-08564c290f7da4c19fbdf84a6d342c94_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b4ad28fea2a6dce87174d4b14298bf9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-08564c290f7da4c19fbdf84a6d342c94\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-08564c290f7da4c19fbdf84a6d342c94_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-867e4bbd2f3c2ec94f74d93d278ba0d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2150fed666a98b1babc5aed3a32c18ee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2150fed666a98b1babc5aed3a32c18ee_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-867e4bbd2f3c2ec94f74d93d278ba0d9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2150fed666a98b1babc5aed3a32c18ee\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2150fed666a98b1babc5aed3a32c18ee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-53b3b62b1facc43f8435e8bd1ea10d9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e7ca1138e17511ba1020ecec9e5f2977\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e7ca1138e17511ba1020ecec9e5f2977_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-53b3b62b1facc43f8435e8bd1ea10d9e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e7ca1138e17511ba1020ecec9e5f2977\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e7ca1138e17511ba1020ecec9e5f2977_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"626\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"yewYHb6O\">Anki 是一款能够帮助你规划复习的记忆软件，能够提高长期记忆效率，让记忆不再听天由命。</p><p data-pid=\"b4GT_d0o\">Anki 的使用教程可以看我整理的专栏：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【专栏导航】Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><h2 id=\"sec-3\">如何刷题</h2><p data-pid=\"ePXr01QB\">首先，一定要挑有详细解答的练习册和教辅。答案略的题目都是耍流氓。</p><p data-pid=\"KnJHC6DF\">然后，刷题的目的是找到自己不会的知识，所以千万不要乱猜，没把握的题目也要做个标记。</p><p data-pid=\"9G7Yjkz7\">最后，订正时要仔细阅读错题的答案解析，画出自己之前不会的地方。</p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">刷题和背书如何结合</h2><p data-pid=\"qqCQh0x7\">有人可能会说，刷题 + 背书，不就是背题吗？</p><p data-pid=\"_ol34X8w\">大错特错。</p><p data-pid=\"Ff6o2l1r\">刷一题背一题，你付出的时间性价比太低了，而且遇到原题的概率也非常低。</p><p data-pid=\"Ol13q-Gr\">真正有效率的做法是，背自己错题的答案详解中以前不知道的内容。</p><p data-pid=\"_Am6zmln\">具体怎么背，依然是使用 Anki：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-55b3cf73e8475054f3ab662840d68b03_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-784156a575e5bc07ae8a2c5dc21fffe0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-784156a575e5bc07ae8a2c5dc21fffe0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"652\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-55b3cf73e8475054f3ab662840d68b03_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-784156a575e5bc07ae8a2c5dc21fffe0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-784156a575e5bc07ae8a2c5dc21fffe0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"652\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8806cff2396dc8aa691a72a8d472386a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-34913fc20450420a54ee0e22c8d9ed41\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-34913fc20450420a54ee0e22c8d9ed41_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"652\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8806cff2396dc8aa691a72a8d472386a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-34913fc20450420a54ee0e22c8d9ed41\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-34913fc20450420a54ee0e22c8d9ed41_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"652\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"6nOO1-TM\">要把自己不会的知识做成问答题，这样才能高效的进行自我测试，从而提高记忆效果。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-5\">进一步阅读</h2><p data-pid=\"txWcoXjo\">我和其他同学在高中期间制作的 Anki 牌组：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/487368329\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki 牌组分享</a><p data-pid=\"A5BqiSFz\">Anki 卡片制作方法：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><p data-pid=\"-3XUddVo\">大佬是如何使用 Anki 的：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/equation.jpg\" data-image-height=\"120\" data-image-width=\"120\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/65131722\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mmjang：【三万字长文】量子物理学家是如何使用 Anki 的？</a><p data-pid=\"yiUoLF4O\">Anki 背后的科学原理：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9268cd1d0435215e42750c7d34ecd7b5_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1203\" data-image-width=\"2183\" data-tm-id=\"420105707\" href=\"#/post/420105707\">叶峻峣：(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Derek Sivers"},{"id":"718778050","title":"间隔重复的有效实践","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":286,"minutes":40,"reason":"延伸深读 · Fernando Borretti"},{"id":"593630309","title":"用间隔重复系统来看穿数学概念","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":493,"minutes":25,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"},{"id":"3953703611","title":"运用记忆系统背诵文章段落","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":183,"minutes":28,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"},{"id":"380354533","title":"在课堂上使用间隔重复软件的一年","author":"tanagrabeast","votes":30,"minutes":63,"reason":"延伸深读 · tanagrabeast"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1373610154","title":"anki为什么没有在学生群体中大火起来？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":370,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 370 赞同"},{"id":"3130195046","title":"被北大录取女生分享经验时强调「没手机」，你上大学前有手机吗，是否会影响你的学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":278,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 278 赞同"},{"id":"740820205","title":"怎么获取anki中的分享牌组，怎么下载到anki呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":198,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 198 赞同"},{"id":"2731574667","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆法是否科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":239,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 239 赞同"},{"id":"1993535529","title":"如何看待自己的考研整理的 anki 卡组被白嫖?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":141,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 141 赞同"}]}